{"name":"Acid Trip","aliases":[],"dominant_mana":["U","W"],"game_type":["Midrange"],"family":null,"description":"\nAcid Trip is a midrange deck revolving around the card [Reality Acid](https://scryfall.com/card/tsr/81/reality-acid).\nThe enchantment is used to repeatedly force the opponent to sacrifice key permanents.\n\nTo speed-up the engine, the player tries to [bounce](https://mtg.fandom.com/wiki/Bounce) Reality Acid without waiting for the [Vanishing](https://mtg.fandom.com/wiki/Vanishing) ability to resolve after the 3rd upkeep.\nSeveral cards can cause Reality Acid to [leave the battlefield](https://mtg.fandom.com/wiki/Leaves_the_battlefield), such as [Kor Skyfisher](https://scryfall.com/card/mm3/11/kor-skyfisher), [Teferi's Time Twist](https://scryfall.com/card/war/72/teferis-time-twist), [Aethersnipe](https://scryfall.com/card/uma/44/aethersnipe), [Dream Stalker](https://scryfall.com/card/tsr/63/dream-stalker), and [Drake Familiar](https://scryfall.com/card/rav/44/drake-familiar).\nBounce effects are also used directly on the opponent's permanents whenever possible to control the board.\n\nOnce the board is in control, the player typically wins by beating with creatures like [Seeker of the Way](https://scryfall.com/card/ima/29/seeker-of-the-way) and [Mulldrifter](https://scryfall.com/card/khc/42/mulldrifter).","staples":[{"name":"Azorius Chancery","link":"https://scryfall.com/card/dis/170/azorius-chancery","preview":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/e/5/e58365d2-e4db-444b-b1a9-795668ad3038.jpg"},{"name":"Dream Stalker","link":"https://scryfall.com/card/tsp/58/dream-stalker","preview":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/a/0/a0e8fc8e-3b23-4275-b19b-43aa6a307619.jpg"},{"name":"Island","link":"https://scryfall.com/card/lea/288/island","preview":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/9/0/90a57c0e-fa61-45ef-955d-d296403967d5.jpg"},{"name":"Journey to Nowhere","link":"https://scryfall.com/card/zen/14/journey-to-nowhere","preview":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/0/9/09cfe585-8a55-4b27-89e0-dfb6946fe1f3.jpg"},{"name":"Kabira Crossroads","link":"https://scryfall.com/card/zen/216/kabira-crossroads","preview":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/a/7/a776decb-cdb5-4f41-8a3a-c0cece18eb35.jpg"},{"name":"Kor Skyfisher","link":"https://scryfall.com/card/zen/23/kor-skyfisher","preview":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/b/b/bb2e9465-f5ba-4c7b-9f03-d40dc8394acd.jpg"},{"name":"Lone Missionary","link":"https://scryfall.com/card/roe/34/lone-missionary","preview":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/f/d/fdc00f4b-ca9a-468a-91e1-c81fe6585765.jpg"},{"name":"Mulldrifter","link":"https://scryfall.com/card/lrw/76/mulldrifter","preview":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/a/9/a97cfefa-ade7-49f6-b2aa-1118b9db4935.jpg"},{"name":"Plains","link":"https://scryfall.com/card/lea/286/plains","preview":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/b/1/b1623d57-4729-4796-b3f7-f1837a05c6ed.jpg"},{"name":"Preordain","link":"https://scryfall.com/card/m11/70/preordain","preview":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/e/3/e3868c3d-4fcd-444b-866f-0f8e50ce7b67.jpg"},{"name":"Reality Acid","link":"https://scryfall.com/card/plc/45/reality-acid","preview":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/8/c/8c6ad9c3-b5dd-46a9-8494-8b395e21aedf.jpg"}],"frequent":[{"name":"Faith's Fetters","link":"https://scryfall.com/card/rav/16/faiths-fetters","preview":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/5/b/5b8ffba3-44a9-41ce-a5a1-37413346db2f.jpg"},{"name":"Holy Light","link":"https://scryfall.com/card/drk/10/holy-light","preview":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/c/3/c3c8a850-bc99-4679-a316-45ecdea696b2.jpg"},{"name":"Momentary Blink","link":"https://scryfall.com/card/tsp/29/momentary-blink","preview":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/0/3/032e072a-0630-472b-9106-5df554dff785.jpg"},{"name":"Sea Gate Oracle","link":"https://scryfall.com/card/roe/85/sea-gate-oracle","preview":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/f/d/fd056c91-5026-41ea-bc9e-6807